### Seed Data: Sales Orders with Add-ons

### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

# ==================== SALES ORDERS ====================

### Create Sales Order with Multiple Items + Add-ons
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "GVBA",
  "orderDate": "2026-01-01",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "quantity": 50,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 220,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1,
      "serviceTypeId": 1,
      "serviceOptionId": 1,
      "labelSource": "COMPANY",
      "addons": [
        {
          "addonId": 1,
          "quantity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "itemId": 2,
      "quantity": 30,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 250,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1,
      "serviceTypeId": 1,
      "serviceOptionId": 2,
      "labelSource": "COMPANY",
      "addons": [
        {
          "addonId": 2,
          "quantity": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

# ==================== VERIFICATION ====================

### Get Sales Order by ID
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List All Sales Orders
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

